1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,300
Why don't we just put a danger sign on buried nuclear waste?

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,820
Because it stays deadly for over ten thousand years.

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:09,620
But we can barely read English from a thousand years ago.

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,100
Scary pictures?

5
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:13,300
Egyptians put curses on tombs,

6
00:00:13,340 --> 00:00:15,580
and robbers figured there was treasure inside.

7
00:00:15,860 --> 00:00:16,820
So in the eighties,

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:20,580
two researchers suggested cats that change color near radiation,

9
00:00:20,740 --> 00:00:23,620
plus a legend: if the cat changes color,

10
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:24,420
run.
